WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
Let's go and send it to Boss Ling.

2
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:05,280
Brother, the police are here

3
00:00:07,210 --> 00:00:09,810
Boss Ling, the clues you provided are very crucial.

4
00:00:09,810 --> 00:00:11,610
There is news about the fake coffee case

5
00:00:11,610 --> 00:00:12,810
Yangfeng has already caught the goods

6
00:00:12,810 --> 00:00:14,610
The fake beverage factory behind it was also shut down

7
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:15,810
This is a police reward

8
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:17,610
Brocade paint and three thousand cash

9
00:00:17,610 --> 00:00:19,810
There's also a bonus. I'll pour you two a cup of hot tea.

10
00:00:19,810 --> 00:00:21,810
No, I still have official duties, so walk slowly.

11
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:25,680
One person is half of it. This is because you also contributed.

12
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:28,370
Thank you, brother and dad

13
00:00:28,370 --> 00:00:29,570
I want to make money myself

14
00:00:29,770 --> 00:00:31,000
This is what dad earned

15
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:34,900
But when dad is gone

16
00:00:35,390 --> 00:00:37,390
Aren’t these all from fish?

17
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:41,620
Your dad and I are only in my twenties
